{"seq":1,"slug":"semantic-query-compilation-sql-generation","title":"语义查询编译：从指标请求到 SQL 的编译过程","url":"/l-doc-books/h/data-science/metrics-semantic-layer-headless-bi-metrics-store/query-compilation-caching/semantic-query-compilation-sql-generation","wordCount":2549,"readingTime":11,"html":"<h1 id=\"语义查询编译-从指标请求到-sql-的编译过程\">语义查询编译：从指标请求到 SQL 的编译过程</h1><p>一个跨境卖家在 BI 面板上点了「按目的国看最近 30 天 GMV」，这个动作在语义层内部发生了两件不同的事：先是<strong>语义解析</strong>——把 <code>GMV</code> 展开成哪个 measure、按哪个时间维度截断、哪些维度需要 join；再是<strong>SQL 编译</strong>——把解析结果落成一段可在 Snowflake / BigQuery / Databricks 上跑的、确定性的 SQL。前者决定「数对不对」，后者决定「跑不跑得动、能不能缓存」。本文只讲后者：语义层如何把一次指标请求编译成 SQL，跨平台差异在哪，以及为什么编译产物必须<strong>可复现</strong>才能支撑下游缓存与预聚合。</p>\n<h2 id=\"核心概念-编译器的三重职责\">核心概念：编译器的三重职责</h2><p>语义层的编译器不是一个「翻译器」，而是三个角色的叠加：<strong>展开</strong>抽象指标——一个 <code>derived</code> 指标可能引用多个 <code>simple</code> 指标，每个又来自不同语义模型；<strong>规划</strong> join 与聚合顺序——先按最细粒度算 measure 再上卷，还是先过滤再聚合；<strong>渲染</strong>方言 SQL——<code>date_trunc</code>、<code>percentile</code>、窗口函数在不同引擎语法不同。dbt 的 MetricFlow 把这三步统一在一次查询渲染中，并提供一个关键开关：查询时加 <code>compile=true</code> 就直接返回编译后的 SQL（docs.getdbt.com/docs/build/metricflow-time-spine）。</p>\n<p>编译的输入是一个结构化的<strong>指标请求</strong>，而不是字符串。以 Cube 为例，请求体是 JSON：<code>measures</code>、<code>dimensions</code>、<code>filters</code>、<code>timeDimensions</code>、<code>limit</code> 各占一个字段，<code>MEASURE(orders.count)</code> 这类成员名由解析器映射到语义对象（docs.cube.dev，Core Data APIs）。这层结构化是编译能确定的前提——自然语言里的「最近 30 天」被固定成 <code>dateRange</code>，而不是让编译器猜。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph TD&#10;R[指标请求&lt;br/&gt;measures + dimensions&lt;br/&gt;+ timeDimensions + filters] --&gt; P[语义解析&lt;br/&gt;展开 derived / ratio&lt;br/&gt;确定粒度与 join 图]&#10;P --&gt; A[聚合规划&lt;br/&gt;最细粒度算 measure&lt;br/&gt;再上卷 / 窗口]&#10;A --&gt; J[join 规划&lt;br/&gt;实体配对&lt;br/&gt;FULL OUTER / LEFT]&#10;J --&gt; D[方言渲染&lt;br/&gt;date_trunc / percentile&lt;br/&gt;窗口函数]&#10;D --&gt; S[确定性 SQL&lt;br/&gt;可编译校验 / 可缓存]&#10;S --&gt; C[缓存键&lt;br/&gt;+ 预聚合匹配]&#10;\">graph TD\nR[指标请求&lt;br/&gt;measures + dimensions&lt;br/&gt;+ timeDimensions + filters] --&gt; P[语义解析&lt;br/&gt;展开 derived / ratio&lt;br/&gt;确定粒度与 join 图]\nP --&gt; A[聚合规划&lt;br/&gt;最细粒度算 measure&lt;br/&gt;再上卷 / 窗口]\nA --&gt; J[join 规划&lt;br/&gt;实体配对&lt;br/&gt;FULL OUTER / LEFT]\nJ --&gt; D[方言渲染&lt;br/&gt;date_trunc / percentile&lt;br/&gt;窗口函数]\nD --&gt; S[确定性 SQL&lt;br/&gt;可编译校验 / 可缓存]\nS --&gt; C[缓存键&lt;br/&gt;+ 预聚合匹配]\n</pre><p>编译产物之所以要「确定性」，是因为它同时是<strong>缓存键</strong>和<strong>预聚合匹配的比对对象</strong>：同一请求编译两次必须逐字节相同（或在规范形式上等价），否则缓存永远命不中，预聚合也永远匹配不上。这解释了为什么语义层宁可让编译器啰嗦（多套几层 CTE），也不做依赖执行计划的激进重写。</p>\n<h2 id=\"聚合规划-measure-是编译的原子单位\">聚合规划：measure 是编译的原子单位</h2><p>编译器真正开始生成 SQL 的位置，是每个 measure 展开成一个独立的聚合子查询。dbt 文档把 measure 定义为「对你的模型中的列执行的聚合」，并给出可用的 <code>agg</code> 集合：<code>sum</code>、<code>max</code>、<code>min</code>、<code>average</code>、<code>median</code>、<code>count_distinct</code>、<code>percentile</code>、<code>sum_boolean</code>（docs.getdbt.com/docs/build/measures）。</p>\n<p>编译的粒度规则可以写成一句话：<strong>先在能表达该 measure 的最细粒度上求值，再逐级上卷</strong>。设请求按目的国与月份聚合 GMV，而事实表粒度是订单行 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>i</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">i</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6595em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">i</span></span></span></span></span>：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mtext>GMV</mtext><mrow><mtext>country</mtext><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mtext>month</mtext></mrow></msub><mo>=</mo><munder><mo>∑</mo><mrow><mi>i</mi><mo>∈</mo><mtext>country</mtext><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mtext>month</mtext></mrow></munder><msub><mi>q</mi><mi>i</mi></msub><mo>⋅</mo><msub><mi>p</mi><mi>i</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\text{GMV}_{\\text{country},\\text{month}} = \\sum_{i \\in \\text{country},\\text{month}} q_i \\cdot p_i</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.9694em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">GMV</span></span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">country</span></span><span class=\"mpunct mtight\">,</span><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">month</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:2.4882em;vertical-align:-1.4382em;\"></span><span class=\"mop op-limits\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.05em;\"><span style=\"top:-1.8479em;margin-left:0em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.05em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span><span class=\"mrel mtight\">∈</span><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">country</span></span><span class=\"mpunct mtight\">,</span><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">month</span></span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.05em;\"></span><span><span class=\"mop op-symbol large-op\">∑</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.4382em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">q</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0359em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">⋅</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.625em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">p</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></div><p>这个形式看起来平凡，但只要 measure 不可加，编译器就必须改变结构。dbt 用 <code>non_additive_dimension</code> 声明半可加度量：给定时间维度 <code>subscription_date</code>、<code>window_choice: max</code>，编译器会取<strong>窗口末端</strong>的值，而非把每一天加起来（docs.getdbt.com/docs/build/measures）：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mtext>MRR</mtext><mi>t</mi></msub><mo>=</mo><munder><mo>∑</mo><mi>u</mi></munder><msub><mtext>MRR</mtext><mrow><mi>u</mi><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mtext> </mtext><msub><mi>t</mi><mi>max</mi><mo>⁡</mo></msub></mrow></msub><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mspace width=\"2em\"/><msub><mi>t</mi><mi>max</mi><mo>⁡</mo></msub><mo>=</mo><mi>max</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">{</mo><msup><mi>t</mi><mo mathvariant=\"normal\" lspace=\"0em\" rspace=\"0em\">′</mo></msup><mo>≤</mo><mi>t</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">}</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\text{MRR}_{t} = \\sum_{u} \\text{MRR}_{u,\\, t_{\\max}},\\qquad t_{\\max}=\\max\\{t&#x27; \\le t\\}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">MRR</span></span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2806em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">t</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:2.3em;vertical-align:-1.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mop op-limits\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.05em;\"><span style=\"top:-1.9em;margin-left:0em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.05em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">u</span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.05em;\"></span><span><span class=\"mop op-symbol large-op\">∑</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.25em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">MRR</span></span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2806em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">u</span><span class=\"mpunct mtight\">,</span><span class=\"mspace mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.1952em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">t</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1645em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.357em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.0714em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.5em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size3 size1 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mop mtight\"><span class=\"mtight\">m</span><span class=\"mtight\">a</span><span class=\"mtight\">x</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.143em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:2em;\"></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mop mtight\"><span class=\"mtight\">m</span><span class=\"mtight\">a</span><span class=\"mtight\">x</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.0519em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mop\">max</span><span class=\"mopen\">{</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8019em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.113em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">′</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">≤</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span><span class=\"mclose\">}</span></span></span></span></span></div><p>注意式中对用户 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>u</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">u</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">u</span></span></span></span></span> 的求和仍在，因为 <code>window_groupings: [user_id]</code> 保留了每个用户的分组——「按用户求和、按时间取末值」这个组合正是编译器要精确表达的语义。忽略它，MRR 会随月份线性膨胀，这是语义层最常见的静默错误之一。此外 measure 已被官方标记为 deprecated，推荐迁移到 <code>type: simple</code>，但编译器内部仍以 measure 为聚合原子。</p>\n<p><code>expr</code> 字段则把方言问题推给了指标作者：dbt 文档明确要求「使用 <code>expr</code> 中的 SQL 函数时，始终使用数据平台特定的 SQL」。这意味着同一份语义定义在跨引擎部署时需要重写 <code>expr</code>，编译器本身不做方言适配——它只保证 <code>agg</code> 到引擎聚合函数的映射。</p>\n<h2 id=\"join-规划与多指标合并\">join 规划与多指标合并</h2><p>单个指标的编译是「聚合 + 上卷」，多指标的编译则是<strong>合并问题</strong>。当一次请求同时要 GMV 和订单数，且两者来自不同语义模型时，编译器不能简单地在同一个 <code>FROM</code> 里写两个聚合——那会因 join 而 fan-out。正确做法是：<strong>每个 measure 在自己的子查询里按请求维度聚合，再用共同维度做外连接合并</strong>。Cube 与 MetricFlow 都遵循这一模式；Cube 的查询编排在合并阶段对维度键取合并、对缺失的度量填零，从而保证任一维度组合在每个 measure 上都有值。这类细节要在引擎实现里核对，因为「缺失填 0」与「缺失留空」在图上含义完全不同。</p>\n<p>多指标合并还与语义层的 join 图约束耦合。编译器的 join 规划必须遵守语义图定下的合法性矩阵——外键可指向主键/唯一键，反向会 fan-out 而被拒绝（详见同章 <a href=\"../semantic-graph-metrics-catalog/semantic-graph-entity-join-path\">语义图：实体关系、join 路径与一致性维度的建模</a>）。编译阶段要做的是<strong>把图的约束变成 SQL 结构</strong>：fan-out 检测发生在规划期而非运行期，这正是无头 BI 相对手写 SQL 的核心收益。Databricks 的指标视图把 <code>cardinality</code> 默认为 <code>many_to_one</code> 并在多行匹配时取首个匹配行，同时提供 <code>rely.at_most_one_match: true</code>——但官方承认该声明在运行时<strong>不做校验</strong>（docs.databricks.com）。<strong>编译期默认值不等于运行期保证</strong>，这在跨引擎迁移时尤其要留意。</p>\n<h2 id=\"时间语义编译-截断-时间脊与窗口\">时间语义编译：截断、时间脊与窗口</h2><p>时间是最能把编译器区分开的一维。普通指标改粒度只涉及 <code>date_trunc</code>：请求周粒度就把 <code>metric_time__day</code> 截断到周。但当指标是<strong>累计型</strong>时这条路走不通——dbt 文档明确指出累计指标非可加，「值不能被相加」，因此 <code>date_trunc</code> 无法重新聚合它（docs.getdbt.com/docs/build/cumulative）。编译器改用<strong>窗口函数</strong>：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mtext>period_agg</mtext><mo fence=\"false\" stretchy=\"true\" minsize=\"1.8em\" maxsize=\"1.8em\">(</mo><mtext>cum</mtext><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>t</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><msub><mo fence=\"false\" stretchy=\"true\" minsize=\"1.8em\" maxsize=\"1.8em\">)</mo><mi>w</mi></msub><mo>=</mo><mtext>first_value</mtext><mo fence=\"false\" stretchy=\"true\" minsize=\"1.2em\" maxsize=\"1.2em\">(</mo><mtext>cum</mtext><mo fence=\"false\" stretchy=\"true\" minsize=\"1.2em\" maxsize=\"1.2em\">)</mo><mtext> over </mtext><mo fence=\"false\" stretchy=\"true\" minsize=\"1.2em\" maxsize=\"1.2em\">(</mo><mtext>partition by </mtext><mi>w</mi><mtext> order by </mtext><mi>t</mi><mo fence=\"false\" stretchy=\"true\" minsize=\"1.2em\" maxsize=\"1.2em\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\text{period\\_agg}\\Big(\\text{cum}(t)\\Big)_{w} = \\text{first\\_value}\\big(\\text{cum}\\big)\\ \\text{over}\\ \\big(\\text{partition by } w\\ \\text{order by } t\\big)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.8497em;vertical-align:-0.6997em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">period_agg</span></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"delimsizing size2\">(</span></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">cum</span></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"delimsizing size2\">)</span></span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:-0.3983em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.0003em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0269em;\">w</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.6997em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.2em;vertical-align:-0.35em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">first_value</span></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"delimsizing size1\">(</span></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">cum</span></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"delimsizing size1\">)</span></span><span class=\"mspace\"> </span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">over</span></span><span class=\"mspace\"> </span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"delimsizing size1\">(</span></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">partition by </span></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0269em;\">w</span><span class=\"mspace\"> </span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">order by </span></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"delimsizing size1\">)</span></span></span></span></span></span></div><p><code>period_agg</code> 默认是 <code>first</code>，可选 <code>last</code> 或 <code>average</code>；编译到 SQL 就是 <code>first_value(...) over (partition by ... order by metric_time__day rows between unbounded preceding and unbounded following)</code>。</p>\n<p>时间脊（time spine）是另一个编译期决策点。当指标是累计型、带 offset、是转化指标、涉及 SCD Type II，或标记了 <code>join_to_timespine: true</code> 时，编译器会注入一次对时间脊模型的 join，join 键是时间脊模型的 <code>standard_granularity_column</code>（docs.getdbt.com/docs/build/metricflow-time-spine）。编译器还会<strong>选最粗的兼容粒度</strong>：有月末脊就用月脊，只有日脊就选日脊再 <code>date_trunc</code> 到月。三种累计语义在 SQL 上的区别很具体：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>累计语义</th>\n<th>编译出的 join 条件（示意）</th>\n<th>含义</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>全时段累计</td>\n<td><code>date_trunc(&#39;day&#39;, src.created_at) &lt;= spine.metric_time__day</code></td>\n<td>从最早一行累加到当前天</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>滑动窗口（7 天）</td>\n<td><code>spine2.metric_time &lt;= spine1.metric_time</code> 且 <code>&gt; dateadd(day, -7, spine1.metric_time)</code></td>\n<td>每天回看 7 天</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>期间至今（月）</td>\n<td><code>... &gt;= date_trunc(&#39;month&#39;, spine.date_day)</code></td>\n<td>每月初重新开始累加</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p><code>window</code> 与 <code>grain_to_date</code> <strong>互斥</strong>，且一旦用了 <code>window</code>，查询<strong>必须</strong>把 <code>metric_time</code> 作为维度带上。派生指标的编译是另一套结构：<code>derived</code> 用 <code>expr</code> 引用 <code>input_metrics</code>，每个 input 可有独立的 <code>alias</code>、<code>filter</code> 和 <code>offset_window</code>。dbt 文档描述了 offset 的执行顺序：先在**最细粒度（当前是 day）**取出未聚合数据集 → 做 <strong>offset join</strong> → <code>date_trunc</code> 到请求粒度并聚合 → 最后求值 <code>expr</code>（docs.getdbt.com/docs/build/derived）。以环比为例：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mtext>growth</mtext><mi>t</mi></msub><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><msub><mi>m</mi><mi>t</mi></msub><mo>−</mo><msubsup><mi>m</mi><mi>t</mi><mtext>offset</mtext></msubsup></mrow><mrow><mo stretchy=\"false\">∣</mo><msubsup><mi>m</mi><mi>t</mi><mtext>offset</mtext></msubsup><mo stretchy=\"false\">∣</mo></mrow></mfrac><mo>×</mo><mn>100</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\text{growth}_{t} = \\frac{m_t - m^{\\text{offset}}_{t}}{\\lvert m^{\\text{offset}}_{t}\\rvert} \\times 100</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.9386em;vertical-align:-0.2441em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">growth</span></span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1864em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.4559em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">t</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2441em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:2.497em;vertical-align:-0.9709em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.5261em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.2791em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen\">∣</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">m</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8309em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.4542em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">t</span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.0448em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">offset</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2458em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose\">∣</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.23em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"frac-line\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.677em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">m</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2806em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">t</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">m</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8491em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.453em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">t</span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">offset</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.247em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.9709em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">×</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">100</span></span></span></span></span></div><p>其中 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msubsup><mi>m</mi><mi>t</mi><mtext>offset</mtext></msubsup></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">m^{\\text{offset}}_{t}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.0961em;vertical-align:-0.247em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">m</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8491em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.453em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">t</span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">offset</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.247em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 是同一指标在 <code>offset_window: 1 month</code> 下的偏移值。注意分母为零的处理——语义层不会替你修正，实际部署里要靠 <code>fill_nulls_with</code> 与 <code>join_to_timespine</code> 把空值补成 0 并保证每个时间点都有行（docs.getdbt.com/docs/build/derived）。这也是编译产物需要<strong>可读、可 diff</strong> 的现实理由：环比翻倍还是分母为零，落到 SQL 里才看得清。</p>\n<h2 id=\"引擎差异与编译校验\">引擎差异与编译校验</h2><p>同一份语义定义在不同引擎上编译出的 SQL 形状不同，但语义层承诺的「同一指标、同一答案」必须成立。Cube 的 SQL API 给出了引擎侧的实现思路：它用 <strong>Apache DataFusion</strong> 做查询规划与执行，用 <strong>egg</strong>——一个 e-graph 项重写库——「分析传入的 SQL 查询，并从大量可能的计划中找出最优计划」（docs.cube.dev，Core Data APIs）。它把查询分成三类：<strong>regular</strong>（常规）、<strong>post-processing</strong>（后处理）、<strong>pushdown</strong>（下推）。关键差异在预聚合：前两类可以使用预聚合，pushdown 类<strong>不能</strong>；三类都可使用内存缓存。<strong>能精确编译成受支持形式的查询，才有资格命中预聚合</strong>。语义层因此愿意对「能不能用预聚合」做一次显式分类，而不是把任意 SQL 都下推。编译重写本身是有界的——Cube 规划失败时会报 <code>Can&#39;t find rewrite due to 10002 AST node limit reached.</code>，并暴露 <code>CUBESQL_REWRITE_MAX_NODES</code>、<code>CUBESQL_REWRITE_MAX_ITERATIONS</code>、<code>CUBESQL_REWRITE_TIMEOUT</code> 三个调优变量（docs.cube.dev）。编译是<strong>有预算的</strong>，不是无限优化。</p>\n<p>编译完成后还有一道校验。生成 SQL 能跑通不代表语义正确：多跳 join 是否歧义、粒度是否错位、<code>non_additive_dimension</code> 是否被正确套用，都要在编译期检查。MetricFlow 的做法是生成后用 <code>explain</code> 校验多跳路径；<code>compile=true</code> 则让任何人在排查时直接看到编译产物。<strong>把编译产物当成一等公民去审查</strong>，是语义层可运维性的底线——下游的缓存、预聚合、以及「为什么这个数和别处对不上」的诊断，全都建立在「能拿到并读懂那段 SQL」之上。</p>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><ul>\n<li>语义层的编译 = 指标展开 + 聚合规划 + join 规划 + 方言渲染，产出必须<strong>确定性</strong>，因为它是缓存键和预聚合匹配的比对对象。</li>\n<li>measure 是编译的原子：先在最细粒度求值再上卷；不可加度量（MRR、余额）用 <code>non_additive_dimension</code> 的窗口末端语义，忽略它会让数字随时间膨胀。</li>\n<li>多指标靠「各自聚合 + 共同维度外连接」合并，而非同一个 <code>FROM</code> 里堆聚合；join 合法性由语义图在<strong>编译期</strong>裁决，与 <a href=\"../semantic-graph-metrics-catalog/semantic-graph-entity-join-path\">语义图：实体关系、join 路径与一致性维度的建模</a> 的约束一致。</li>\n<li>时间语义分三档编译：普通指标用 <code>date_trunc</code>，累计指标（非可加）用 <code>first_value</code> 窗口，带 offset 的派生指标先在最细粒度做 offset join 再上卷；<code>window</code> 与 <code>grain_to_date</code> 互斥。</li>\n<li>编译必须可审查：<code>compile=true</code> 与 <code>explain</code> 是把编译产物变成可诊断工件的手段；可加性问题见 <a href=\"../semantic-layer-motivation-model/measure-aggregation-additivity-derived-metric\">度量、聚合与可加性</a>。</li>\n</ul>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"text\" data-code=\"\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span></span></span></code></pre></div>","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"语义查询编译：从指标请求到 SQL 的编译过程","id":"语义查询编译-从指标请求到-sql-的编译过程"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念：编译器的三重职责","id":"核心概念-编译器的三重职责"},{"level":2,"text":"聚合规划：measure 是编译的原子单位","id":"聚合规划-measure-是编译的原子单位"},{"level":2,"text":"join 规划与多指标合并","id":"join-规划与多指标合并"},{"level":2,"text":"时间语义编译：截断、时间脊与窗口","id":"时间语义编译-截断-时间脊与窗口"},{"level":2,"text":"引擎差异与编译校验","id":"引擎差异与编译校验"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"指标血缘、所有者与口径变更评审流程","url":"/l-doc-books/h/data-science/metrics-semantic-layer-headless-bi-metrics-store/semantic-graph-metrics-catalog/metric-lineage-ownership-change-review"},"next":{"title":"预聚合、物化视图与语义缓存的一致性策略","url":"/l-doc-books/h/data-science/metrics-semantic-layer-headless-bi-metrics-store/query-compilation-caching/pre-aggregation-materialization-cache"}}